        <mxCell id="remaining_v11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=14" value="V1.1 还剩 1 个 hardening 阶段&#xa;&#xa;1. V1.1-RC5 Final Evidence Navigation Release Sync&#xa;   final checklist / docs / scoped commit / push&#xa;&#xa;已完成：&#xa;Source Trace Backend Contract Fix&#xa;V1.1-RC4 Source Trace Re-Smoke Rerun&#xa;&#xa;V1.2+ 产品扩展另算：session 精确导航、多格式、Assessment、Governance、Graph editing、Cloud sync。" vertex="1">
